    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="0746" n="734" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg734"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.00/10–345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Acting Political
                        Adviser in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Atcheson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-03T11:00:00-05:00">October 3, 1945—11
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>13. Please inform the Department what action has been taken regarding the release
                    of Japanese political prisoners. There are reports in America that many have not
                    been liberated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
